---
---

<section class="py-24 md:py-32" id="servicios">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
        <div class="w-1 h-1 bg-blue-primary"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-blue-primary tracking-widest uppercase">Arquitectura del Sistema</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Infraestructura <br/><span class="text-gradient">Digital de Precisión</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Large -->
      <div class="group relative bg-surface border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-primary/50 hover:shadow-glow-primary transition-all duration-300 md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2 overflow-hidden border-corner-tl">
        <!-- Background watermark -->
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="absolute -bottom-10 -right-10 w-64 h-64 text-blue-primary opacity-5 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity duration-500 rotate-12"><path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4"/><path d="m6 8-4 4 4 4"/><path d="m14.5 4-5 16"/></svg>
        
        <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-blue-primary/10 border border-blue-primary/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 group-hover:shadow-glow-primary transition-shadow">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-blue-primary"><path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4"/><path d="m6 8-4 4 4 4"/><path d="m14.5 4-5 16"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-white">Desarrollo Web Moderno</h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
            Aplicaciones ultrarrápidas utilizando arquitecturas modernas y frameworks optimizados para rendimiento y SEO. Construidas como bloques inmutables de código.
          </p>
          
          <ul class="mt-auto flex flex-col gap-4 font-mono text-sm text-muted">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-blue-primary">➜</span> Sitios corporativos escalables</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-blue-primary">➜</span> Aplicaciones Web (SPA/MPA)</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-blue-primary">➜</span> Plataformas SaaS seguras</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Medium -->
      <div class="group relative bg-surface border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-primary/50 hover:shadow-glow-primary transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden border-corner-br">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-primary/10 border border-blue-primary/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:shadow-glow-primary transition-shadow">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-blue-primary"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="3" x2="21" y1="9" y2="9"/><line x1="9" x2="9" y1="21" y2="9"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-white">Diseño UI/UX Premium</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Interfaces minimalistas, intuitivas y de precisión matemática. Centradas en la conversión y usabilidad extrema.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Medium -->
      <div class="group relative bg-surface border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-primary/50 hover:shadow-glow-primary transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-primary/10 border border-blue-primary/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:shadow-glow-primary transition-shadow">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-blue-primary"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-white">Sistemas a Medida</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Arquitectura backend y frontend conectadas sin fricción. Bases de datos robustas y flujos de trabajo automatizados.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Horizontal -->
      <div class="group relative bg-surface border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-primary/50 hover:shadow-glow-primary transition-all duration-300 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-3 overflow-hidden border-corner-tl border-corner-br">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start md:items-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-primary/10 border border-blue-primary/30 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:shadow-glow-primary transition-shadow">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-blue-primary"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"/><path d="m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"/><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0"/><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-white">Consultoría y Escalabilidad</h3>
            <p class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
              Auditorías técnicas, refactorización y arquitectura cloud para preparar tu negocio para el siguiente nivel de transacciones y tráfico. Asegurando que tu producto digital nunca se detenga.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
